* Quadratic Buck Converter
.tran 1n 5m

Vin in 0 12
M1 sw1 in gate 0 NMOS W=10u L=1u
D1 0 sw1 DIODE
L1 sw1 mid 100u
C1 mid 0 100u
M2 sw2 mid gate 0 NMOS W=10u L=1u
D2 0 sw2 DIODE
L2 sw2 out 100u
C2 out 0 100u
Rload out 0 10

Vgate gate 0 PULSE(0 12 0 1n 1n 5u 10u)

.model NMOS NMOS(Vto=1 Kp=2 Lambda=0)
.model DIODE D

.end